e basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general aspects of personal information in short written or spoken conversations about past experiences."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past Tense Pronunciation"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In Simple Past, in affirmative form, the regular verbs have -ed endings.  Regular past tense verbs (-ed ending) are pronounced three different ways: <br><li>t<br><li>d<br><li>id</li><br><br>When a word that ends in a<span class=\"strong\"> consonant </span> is followed by a word that begins with a <span class=\"strong\"> vowel</span>, the words are<span class=\"strong\"> linked</span>. When this happens with words ending in \u201c-ed\u201d, the \u201c-ed\u201dis pronounced clearly."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If the base verb ends in one of these <span class=\\\"italic\\\">sounds</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example base verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ed</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pronounce the <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ed</span> as\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"extra syllable?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"/t/\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">want</br>visit</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">wanted</br>visited</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"id\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"yes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"/d/\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">end</br>need</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ended</br>needed</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"id\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"yes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"unvoiced\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">work <br>laugh</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">worked <br>laughed</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"t\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"no\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"voiced\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">play <br>beg</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">played <br>begged</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"no\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "knowledge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "information you gain through time and experience"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Learn something new and gain some knowledge about your friends to the south."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear on the radio."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to know"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to understand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you know that the pyramid has a total of 365 steps?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "knee"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a part of your body that bends your leg"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Warm up your knees for a long, scenic hikes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "knapsack"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a bag you carry on your back"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bring your knapsack."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "civilization"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the culture, society and life of a particular area"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Learn about past civilizations on our 14-day Mexican tour."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ancient"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very old; from a previous time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Visit the ancient cities and see the Pyramid of the Sun built around 200 A.D."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "journey "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of travel"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A trip to Mexico is a journey in history."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "before your eyes"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " in front of your face"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: See history come alive before your eyes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le04ob04aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le04ob04re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Change the following below to the Past tense. Say a sentence with each verb. <br/><span class=\"italic\">work</span>, <span class=\"italic\">travel</span>, <span class=\"italic\">watch</span>, <span class=\"italic\">want</span>, <span class=\"italic\">stay</span>, <span class=\"italic\">paint</span>, <span class=\"italic\">park</span>, <span class=\"italic\">raise</span>, <span class=\"italic\">flood</span>, <span class=\"italic\">save</span>, <span class=\"italic\">demand</span>, <span class=\"italic\">sound</span>, <span class=\"italic\">need</span>, <span class=\"italic\">mail</span>, <span class=\"italic\">cover</span>, <span class=\"italic\">answer</span>, <span class=\"italic\">cause</span>, <span class=\"italic\">use</span>, <span class=\"italic\">add</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Next, fill in the chart by placing the past tense verbs in the correct columns based on how they are pronounced. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">id</span> sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">d</span> sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">t</span> sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp; <br/>&nbsp; <br/>&nbsp;  <br/> &nbsp; <br/>&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make <span class=\"italic\">-id</span>, <span class=\"italic\">-d</span>, <span class=\"italic\">-t</span> sounds."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I analyze the pronunciation of some words."}]}]}